    "https://yourfuture.sdbor.edu/postings/50432": {
      "title": "Adjunct-Instructor, Lecturer, or Senior Lecturer of Mining Engineering and Management",
      "description": "South Dakota Board of Regents Employment Opportunities | Adjunct-Instructor, Lecturer, or Senior Lecturer of Mining Engineering and Management Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Adjunct-Instructor, Lecturer, or Senior Lecturer of Mining Engineering and Management Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Posting Details Logo Institution South Dakota Mines Working Title Adjunct-Instructor, Lecturer, or Senior Lecturer of Mining Engineering and Management Posting Number F01986P Department SDSMT-Mining Engineering & Management Physical Location of Position (City) Rapid City Posting Text The Mining Engineering and Management department at the South Dakota School of Mines & Technology seeks exceptional candidates to teach a topics course in Advanced Topics in Mining Methods and Safety for the spring 2027 semester. The position may continue semester-by-semester, depending upon performance, department need, funding, and student enrollment. This is a part-time, temporary, non-benefited position. An earned master’s degree or an earned doctorate in mining engineering, or a closely related field is required. An equivalent combination of education and experience may be considered. Experience in industry practice, consulting, training, teaching, or other demonstrated expertise in the subject matter is preferred. Previous experience teaching online, in person, or facilitating training using a learning management system is preferred. Expectations will include teaching both undergraduate and graduate-level courses. Questions about this position may be directed to the search committee chair, Dr. Rudrajit Mitra (Rudrajit.Mitra@sdsmt.edu). To Apply: Applications must be made online at https://yourfuture.sdbor.edu . South Dakota Mines is committed to recruiting and retaining a talented workforce and offers an excellent comprehensive benefits package for employees, spouses an